      "get_batch": "# nodes.get_batch\nGet multiple nodes in a single request (reduces round-trips)\nMaps to: get_node_info_batch\nWrite: no\n\nParams:\n  nodeIds (array, required) — Array of node IDs to fetch\n  detail (summary | standard | full, optional) — Detail level (default: standard)",
