      "update": "# nodes.update\nUpdate properties on one or more nodes. Uses 5-phase ordered execution: (1) simple props (name, x, y, opacity, visible, layoutMode, padding, itemSpacing, alignment, clipsContent, layoutPositioning, gridRowCount, gridColumnCount, gridRowGap, gridColumnGap) → (2) fills/strokes/corners/effects → (3) layout sizing (layoutSizingHorizontal/Vertical) → (4) resize (width/height) → (5) text props (fontSize, fontName, textDecoration, textCase, textAlign, paragraphSpacing). Safe to send layoutMode + width + layoutSizing in the same patch — ordering is handled internally. ⚠️ fillVariableName/strokeVariableName/fontColorVariableName are create_frame aliases — NOT supported here. For post-creation variable binding use variables_ep(method:\"set_binding\") or variables_ep(method:\"batch_bind\"). Strokes require Figma Paint format: [{type:\"SOLID\", color:{r:0,g:0,b:0}}], not hex strings.\nMaps to: patch_nodes\nWrite: yes (access: edit)\n\nParams:\n  patches (array, required)\n  strict (boolean, optional) — When true, reject the entire patch if any property name is not recognized. Default: false (unknown props reported in _unknownProps but patch succeeds).",
